## Detect-only, by design

The watch reports. It does not rebuild AIM-derived packs, does not publish, does not mail, and
never changes a price. If a refresh is wanted, `DELEGATOR_REFRESH_HOWTO.md` sits beside this file
with the exact commands and the list of files that are locked read-only.

